    83	  q1 -->|no| d[GO candidate D<br/>cheaper, no coupling rebuild]
    84	  q1 -->|yes| q2{projected assembled<br/>frame ≤ 33ms?}
    85	  q2 -->|no| q3{coarse pre-pass<br/>or scope trim recovers it?}
    86	  q3 -->|no| fb[NO-GO PB-MPM<br/>fall back: D then B then<br/>two-field coupling-only]
    87	  q3 -->|yes| go
    88	  q2 -->|yes| go[GO PB-MPM<br/>proceed to coupling-rebuild follow-up plan]
    89	```
